#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A match nobody joins closes itself after about fifteen minutes. That is deliberate: an address pasted in a channel would otherwise stay a way into your session for the rest of the day, and a room waiting for nobody is worth less than a fresh one."
msgstr ""

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_game_match_link.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Creating a match link needs a registered nickname you have identified with NickServ, and so does taking the seat. Somebody either of you has blocked cannot join, and neither can you join your own match from a second window."
msgstr ""

